You can eat corpses of dead monsters.  You might want to avoid
kobolds and poison-using monsters, as they will poison you unless
you have poison resistance.  You can find food items lying around,
but it sounds like that's not helping much.  If you avoid praying
for other things, and don't wear rings, you can pray when you get
weak, and your god will feed you to the content rating (not hungry
and not satiated).  Eventually, you'll run across enough food to
last you just about forever.  The rogue level has several rations
in it, every time I've found it, anyway.

That's all I can think of, there are probably other hints about
how to get the most mileage from your food.

